{"id":"6763f8a85fa6a7b0","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-self-referential-sentence.md","title":"Self-Referential Sentence","display":"df-self-referential-sentence — Self-Referential Sentence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-self-referential-sentence","aliases":["90-df-self-referential-sentence"],"display":"df-self-referential-sentence — Self-Referential Sentence","depends_on":["[[90-df-sentence]]","[[90-df-godel-numbering]]","[[90-df-numeral]]","[[90-df-syntax-interface]]","[[90-df-arithmetic-language]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-self-referential-sentence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-self-referential-sentence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-self-referential-sentence — Self-Referential Sentence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"714deb184f73887a\" href=\"?note=714deb184f73887a\" title=\"90-df-sentence\">90-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b86b211a75cf1748\" href=\"?note=b86b211a75cf1748\" title=\"90-df-godel-numbering\">90-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d53b945955293235\" href=\"?note=d53b945955293235\" title=\"90-df-numeral\">90-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"61d70aa13427c3b5\" href=\"?note=61d70aa13427c3b5\" title=\"90-df-syntax-interface\">90-df-syntax-interface</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"278a6c2cfc6160a3\" href=\"?note=278a6c2cfc6160a3\" title=\"90-df-arithmetic-language\">90-df-arithmetic-language</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Nodes}\">\\(\\operatorname{Nodes}\\)</span> 与子树运算直接取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"61d70aa13427c3b5\" href=\"?note=61d70aa13427c3b5\" title=\"90-df-syntax-interface\">90-df-syntax-interface</a> 的有限树递归定义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (fixed effective signature)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span> (sentence, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"714deb184f73887a\" href=\"?note=714deb184f73887a\" title=\"90-df-sentence\">90-df-sentence</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(g:\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\">\\(d:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)\">\\(\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)\\)</span> (effective Gödel numbering, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b86b211a75cf1748\" href=\"?note=b86b211a75cf1748\" title=\"90-df-godel-numbering\">90-df-godel-numbering</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Nodes}(\\sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Nodes}(\\sigma)\\)</span> (finite addresses of the syntax tree <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\mathbin{|}_u\">\\(\\sigma\\mathbin{|}_u\\)</span> (subtree rooted at address <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mentions}_S(\\sigma,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{Mentions}_S(\\sigma,n)\\)</span> (literal numeral-occurrence predicate, defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SynSelfRef}_{S,g}\">\\(\\mathrm{SynSelfRef}_{S,g}\\)</span> (syntactically self-mentioning sentence predicate, defined here)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}self\\text{-}referential\\text{-}sentence}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\left\\{\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Mentions}_S(\\sigma,n)\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists u\\in\\operatorname{Nodes}(\\sigma)\\;\n\\bigl(\\sigma\\mathbin{|}_u=\\overline n\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{SynSelfRef}_{S,g}(\\sigma)\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigl(\n\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\n\\land\\mathrm{Mentions}_S(\\sigma,g(\\sigma))\n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}self\\text{-}referential\\text{-}sentence}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\left\\{\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Mentions}_S(\\sigma,n)\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists u\\in\\operatorname{Nodes}(\\sigma)\\;\n\\bigl(\\sigma\\mathbin{|}_u=\\overline n\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{SynSelfRef}_{S,g}(\\sigma)\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigl(\n\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\n\\land\\mathrm{Mentions}_S(\\sigma,g(\\sigma))\n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mentions}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Mentions}_S\\)</span> 现在由有限语法树的子树出现关系定义，不再是未解释的原始谓词。</li>\n<li>这是依赖具体编码的“字面提及自身数码”概念，与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"af4f7551b0885593\" href=\"?note=af4f7551b0885593\" title=\"90-df-self-reference\">90-df-self-reference</a> 的可证固定点概念不同；字面出现本身并不蕴含任何指定的可证双条件。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"714deb184f73887a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b86b211a75cf1748","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"d53b945955293235","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-syntax-interface","status":"resolved","id":"61d70aa13427c3b5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-syntax-interface]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-arithmetic-language","status":"resolved","id":"278a6c2cfc6160a3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-arithmetic-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-syntax-interface","status":"resolved","id":"61d70aa13427c3b5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}$；$\\operatorname{Nodes}$ 与子树运算直接取 [[90-df-syntax-interface]] 的有限树递归定义。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"714deb184f73887a","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S$ (sentence, see [[90-df-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b86b211a75cf1748","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)$ (effective Gödel numbering, see [[90-df-godel-numbering]])","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-self-reference","status":"resolved","id":"af4f7551b0885593","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"这是依赖具体编码的“字面提及自身数码”概念，与 [[90-df-self-reference]] 的可证固定点概念不同；字面出现本身并不蕴含任何指定的可证双条件。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Nodes}","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S","display":false},{"tex":"g:\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"d:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\operatorname{Expr}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Nodes}(\\sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\mathbin{|}_u","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mentions}_S(\\sigma,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SynSelfRef}_{S,g}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}self\\text{-}referential\\text{-}sentence}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\left\\{\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Mentions}_S(\\sigma,n)\n&\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists u\\in\\operatorname{Nodes}(\\sigma)\\;\n\\bigl(\\sigma\\mathbin{|}_u=\\overline n\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{SynSelfRef}_{S,g}(\\sigma)\n&\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigl(\n\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\n\\land\\mathrm{Mentions}_S(\\sigma,g(\\sigma))\n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mentions}_S","display":false}],"bytes":2036,"backlinks":[{"id":"da1a6647840ffca5","anchor":"ref-23","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-self-referential-sentence]]"},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-89","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-1-consistency.md]]\n[[90-df-addition-function.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetic-language.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetization.md]]\n[[90-df-berry-paradox.md]]\n[[90-df-cantor-diagonal.md]]\n[[90-df-closure-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-comparison-function.